{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Pre-review citation sweep against origin/main e21f3240cd0 (the plan was swept on 403719c01ce; cb2b has landed since).\n\nCORRECT and left alone: AC2's whole pre-state -- 14 hits across 5 files, and every cited line (reconcile-bridge-canary.yml:28,34,54,134; canary_bridge.py:140-143,687; test_canary_bridge.py:71; test_canary_bridge_heldout.py:74,122,145,168; test_canary_status_refs_heldout.py:133) lands exactly. Also correct: gen_env_registry.py:400,406; _config_sources.py:289; generate_config_surface_golden.py:48; jira-sync-setup.md:191,294; ADR 0094:81-82.\n\nTen citations had drifted, all corrected:\n\n| Plan said | Actual |\n|---|---|\n| [Unreleased] :11 is EMPTY | :11 has ### Changed :13 + cb2b's bullet :15-30 |\n| [0.14.0] ### Changed :13, subsection :15 | [0.14.0] :32, ### Changed :34 |\n| [0.13.0] :258-503 | :277-521 |\n| force=/force_close bullet :489-496 | :508-515 |\n| openai-chat bullet :498-502 | :517-521 |\n| historical cross-ref :620 | :639 |\n| 2025 force_close entry :1342 | :1361 |\n| docs/architecture.md:629 | :669 |\n| _check_github_heartbeat NEVER_RUN bootstrap :203-212 | def :255, call site :187-196, bootstrap param :261 |\n| if bootstrap conditional :345 | ternary :329 |\n\nThe most consequential one is the first: the plan's instruction was to CREATE the [Unreleased] subsection. cb2b already created it and filed a bullet there, so following the plan literally would have produced a duplicate heading. The approach now says append to the existing :13.\n\nConfirmed unchanged: grep REBAR_HLC CHANGELOG.md is still empty, so AC3's premise that 81da792 has no entry holds.\n\nDescription is 7993 chars (budget 8000); the net growth was absorbed by dropping a stale clause about cb2b landing ahead of this story, which it now has.\n\nNOT corrected -- flagging for the reviewer rather than silently editing: AC4's clause 'check_mechanism_delt